WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.529
Feather groaned as she looked around Fairy Grove.

2
00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:12.808
Dirty dishes sat on a table.

3
00:00:12.809 --> 00:00:17.311
The furniture looked dull and dusty.

4
00:00:17.312 --> 00:00:21.035
Wind blew litter around the clearing.

5
00:00:21.036 --> 00:00:24.994
"This place looks terrible," Feather thought.

6
00:00:24.995 --> 00:00:35.562
"We need to clean it."

7
00:00:35.563 --> 00:00:40.631
Feather got out some cleaning supplies.

8
00:00:40.632 --> 00:00:43.532
Then she clapped her hands.

9
00:00:43.533 --> 00:00:47.642
"Time for a meeting, everyone!" she called.

10
00:00:47.643 --> 00:00:51.632
The other fairies flew over.

11
00:00:51.633 --> 00:00:54.530
"What's up?" Hob asked.

12
00:00:54.531 --> 00:00:58.056
Bumble looked worried. "Am I in trouble?

13
00:00:58.057 --> 00:01:02.690
Did I do something wrong?"

14
00:01:02.691 --> 00:01:07.032
"I know what's wrong." Sprite rolled her eyes.

15
00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:11.458
"Feather wants us to clean again."

16
00:01:11.459 --> 00:01:14.845
"That's right." Feather nodded.

17
00:01:14.846 --> 00:01:19.271
"Fairy Grove is a mess."

18
00:01:19.272 --> 00:01:22.186
Feather handed out cleaning supplies.

19
00:01:22.187 --> 00:01:27.495
"Hob, here's dish soap—you can wash the dishes.

20
00:01:27.496 --> 00:01:31.455
Bumble, you can pick up the litter.

21
00:01:31.456 --> 00:01:34.263
And, Sprite, you can—"

22
00:01:34.264 --> 00:01:37.156
Sprite put her fingers in her ears.

23
00:01:37.157 --> 00:01:41.326
"La-la-la-la!" she sang loudly.

24
00:01:41.327 --> 00:01:45.110
Feather frowned. "Come on, Sprite.

25
00:01:45.111 --> 00:01:47.827
We need to clean up."

26
00:01:47.828 --> 00:01:51.970
"No, we don't." Sprite shook her head.

27
00:01:51.971 --> 00:01:54.973
"You're too fussy sometimes, Feather.

28
00:01:54.974 --> 00:01:59.839
A little dirt never hurt anyone."

29
00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:04.182
Hob nodded. "Fairy Grove looks fine.

30
00:02:04.183 --> 00:02:07.596
Let's play tag or hide-and-seek."

31
00:02:07.597 --> 00:02:11.691
"Um . . ." Bumble was staring at something.

32
00:02:11.692 --> 00:02:17.361
"I'm not sure we have time for games—or cleaning."

33
00:02:17.362 --> 00:02:20.067
The other fairies looked over.

34
00:02:20.068 --> 00:02:24.083
Wish smoke was blowing into the clearing.

35
00:02:24.084 --> 00:02:29.231
Sprite did a flip. "Here comes a birthday wish!"

36
00:02:29.232 --> 00:02:33.440
"Oh well." Hob grinned and dropped the soap.

37
00:02:33.441 --> 00:02:38.302
"I guess we can't clean up!"

38
00:02:38.303 --> 00:02:44.419
The fairies gathered around the wish smoke.

39
00:02:44.420 --> 00:02:47.762
"Cute wish," Bumble said.

40
00:02:47.763 --> 00:02:49.820
The other fairies nodded.

41
00:02:49.821 --> 00:03:05.951
A girl named Mabel wished for a puppy.

42
00:03:05.952 --> 00:03:11.825
Just then a strong wind gusted.

43
00:03:11.826 --> 00:03:15.870
Hob looked at the sky. "It's really windy.

44
00:03:15.871 --> 00:03:18.507
I think a storm is coming."

45
00:03:18.508 --> 00:03:21.635
"Then let's get going," Sprite said.

46
00:03:21.636 --> 00:03:34.883
"Before the wind blows away the wish smoke!"

